# CipherGuard & SilentSnare - Environment Configuration
# =========================================================

# Vercel Postgres / Neon Serverless Database URL
# When deployed on Vercel, this variable is automatically injected.
# For local connection to your Neon / Vercel Postgres database, uncomment and paste your connection string:
# POSTGRES_URL="postgresql://user:password@ep-cool-sample-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@ep-cool-sample-123456.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"

# Note: If no POSTGRES_URL is provided, CipherGuard automatically runs on its built-in
# local SQLite engine (cipherguard.db) without requiring any cloud setup.
